('Deadlift (heavy)', 'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=heavy+deadlift+proper+form+tutorial', 'Heavy single or triple. Set up carefully, brace hard. Pull with perfect form. Reset between reps. Max strength test.', 'Hamstrings, Glutes, Back, Core', 'advanced'),
